  "title": "Momma's Cornbread Dressing",
  "description": "Crumbled cornbread, chopped hard-boiled eggs, onion, garlic, sage and celery are in this stuffing or dressing. It's moistened with chicken and turkey broth and can be used to stuff a 12 to 15 pound turkey.",
  "authors": [
    "Sherry Wisdom"
